Today is Sunday morning.
I am standing near the window of my apartment.
It is raining very heavily outside.
Suddenly dark clouds came and this rain started.
This is the Mumbai monsoon.
That street is completely wet.
Looking outside the window, I think about old things.
Five months ago, I arrived in Mumbai.
It was the month of January then.
At that time, the weather here was very different.
The air was very mild and dry then.
But now this weather is very intense.
Five months ago, I was not used to this city at all.
But now I like this city and this weather.
Those trees are looking nice in the rain.
Now the rain has lessened a bit.
I take my umbrella and get ready to go outside.
